The checker now accepts the `representation:` line under D15 clarification 1, and both commits went through. The full suite went from **560 to 571 tests, all OK** (+11, all in `tests/test_ingest.py`). I checked the snapshot hashes first: `PROTOCOL.md` and `LARQL-LOGIT-DUMP-SPEC.md` both match. Nothing was pushed.

