- **`refcheck/ingest.py`**
  - Adds the constant `REPRESENTATION_REQUIRED` and the function `representation_line_ok`.
  - `_check_stdout` no longer holds `representation` in its whole-line table. It sends that kind through `representation_line_ok`.
